        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 2,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "Android devices with 16 KB memory pages are rolling out. If a Capacitor plugin (or one of its native dependencies) isn’t ready, a feature may stop working or the app may crash on some phones. Enforcement is ramping up, so plan a fix soon."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 4,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 4,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "Important: Starting November 1st, 2025, all new apps and updates to existing apps submitted to Google Play and targeting Android 15+ devices must support 16 KB page sizes on 64-bit devices."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 6,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
